# GitHub token. Reviews are posted as its owner. Read access is enough to draft;
# posting reviews and labels needs pull request write access (fine-grained) or
# the repo / public_repo scope (classic). See docs/guide.md.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Claude Code auth, one of:
#   subscription: run `claude setup-token` on any machine and paste the token
#   API billing:  set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY instead
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
